{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32446","headline":"题李卫公诗二首 一 · 温庭筠","name":"题李卫公诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蒿棘深春卫国门，九年於此盗乾坤。\n两行密疏倾天下，一夜阴谋达至尊。\n肉视具僚忘匕箸，气吞同列削寒温。\n当时谁是承恩者，肯有余波达鬼邨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32446.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32446","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}